<!--
  A real-world incoming e-invoice, in the SI-UBL 1.2 shape Dutch suppliers still
  send. Trimmed from an actual document; the embedded PDF is a stub.

  Deliberately exercises everything Peppol BIS 3.0 would have made easier:
    - no cbc:DueDate      — the due date lives in PaymentMeans/PaymentDueDate
    - no ClassifiedTaxCategory on the lines — the rate is only in the line's own
                            TaxTotal/TaxSubtotal
    - a document-level AllowanceCharge, which a purchase has no field for
    - an EmbeddedDocumentBinaryObject carrying the human-readable PDF
-->
